From 30dd395343a3c542660c557d1986c6668a3da204 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RSC-RJCgit <142757046+RSC-RJCgit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 20 May 2026 13:58:27 +0930
Subject: [PATCH] Add automation-state module: states tab, storage, set/check
 triggers
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Port the full automation-state module from AndroidAPSa320:
- AutomationStatePlugin with States tab (fragment + RecyclerView)
- AutomationStateService implementing AutomationStateInterface
- AutomationAddStateDialog / AutomationStateValuesDialog
- AutomationStateStringKey for persisting state data
- Dagger wiring: AutomationStateModule in AppComponent,
  AutomationStatePlugin bound in PluginsListModule
- settings.gradle and app/build.gradle.kts updated

ActionSetAutomationState and TriggerAutomationState were already
present but had no backing implementation — this fixes them.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
